- Literature survey: Systematic review of 68+ references spanning
  6G security, ZTA frameworks, authentication, access control,
  AI/ML security, blockchain trust, and industry case studies.
- Comparative analysis: Side-by-side comparison of authentication
  methods (password vs. MFA vs. biometric vs. behavioral/continuous)
  and access control models (RBAC vs. ABAC vs. PBAC) across dimensions
  of security strength, latency, scalability, and deployment complexity.
